{
    "cells": [
        {
            "language": "markdown",
            "source": [
                "# Semantic Query Runner — `ml_*` vía `mcp-core-sdk`\n\nEste cuaderno ejecuta de forma mecánica el pack mínimo de semantic queries definido en `tmp/plantilla-semantic-query-ml.md` y escribe un markdown por sección en `tmp/`.\n\n## Entradas\n- `tmp/plantilla-semantic-query-ml.md`\n- colecciones Chroma `ml_*`\n\n## Salidas\n- `tmp/seccion-1-ml_hilo_narrativo.md`\n- `tmp/seccion-2-ml_piezas_media.md`\n- `tmp/seccion-3-ml_recursos.md`\n- `tmp/seccion-4-ml_eventos.md`\n- `tmp/seccion-5-ml_personajes.md`\n\n## Flujo\n1. Bootstrap vendor-first con `BasicVectorMachine`\n2. Parseo de la plantilla markdown\n3. Query semántica por sección\n4. Render markdown + escritura idempotente\n\n> Prerrequisitos: Chroma accesible y `MCPGallery/mcp-core-sdk` compilado."
            ],
            "outputs": []
        },
        {
            "language": "typescript",
            "source": [
                "const path = require('path');\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst { execSync } = require('child_process');\n\nfunction resolveHomeDirectory() {\n  const homeDirectory = process.env.HOME || process.env.USERPROFILE;\n  if (!homeDirectory) {\n    throw new Error('HOME / USERPROFILE is required to resolve notebook paths.');\n  }\n  return homeDirectory;\n}\n\nconst HOME_DIR = resolveHomeDirectory();\nconst SCRIPTORIUM_ROOT = path.join(HOME_DIR, 'OASIS', 'aleph-scriptorium');\nconst WORKSPACE_ROOT = path.join('c:', 'Users', 'aleph', 'Desktop', 'TEST');\nconst TMP_DIR = path.join(WORKSPACE_ROOT, 'tmp');\nconst TEMPLATE_FILE = path.join(TMP_DIR, 'plantilla-semantic-query-ml.md');\nconst NNB_DIR = path.join(SCRIPTORIUM_ROOT, 'VectorMachineSDK');\nconst VECTOR_DB_DIST = path.join(\n  SCRIPTORIUM_ROOT,\n  'MCPGallery',\n  'mcp-core-sdk',\n  'dist',\n  'vector-db'\n);\n\nconst neededPackages = ['chromadb-default-embed'];\nconst missingPackages = neededPackages.filter(function(pkg) {\n  return !fs.existsSync(path.join(NNB_DIR, 'node_modules', pkg));\n});\nif (missingPackages.length) {\n  console.log(`📦 Instalando dependencias notebook: ${missingPackages.join(', ')}`);\n  execSync(`npm install ${missingPackages.join(' ')}`, { cwd: NNB_DIR, stdio: 'pipe' });\n  console.log('✓ Dependencias instaladas');\n}\n\nconst coreExports = require(VECTOR_DB_DIST);\nconst BasicVectorMachine = coreExports.BasicVectorMachine;\nif (!BasicVectorMachine) {\n  throw new Error(\n    `BasicVectorMachine no encontrado en ${VECTOR_DB_DIST}. Ejecuta npm run build en MCPGallery/mcp-core-sdk.`\n  );\n}\n\nconst notebookGlobal = globalThis;\nconst vm = notebookGlobal.__semanticVm || new BasicVectorMachine();\nnotebookGlobal.__semanticVm = vm;\n\nif (typeof vm.getChromaClient !== 'function') {\n  throw new Error('BasicVectorMachine no expone getChromaClient(); revisa la versión del mcp-core-sdk.');\n}\n\nconst client = vm.getChromaClient();\nconst heartbeat = await vm.connectChroma();\nconst mlCollections = await vm.listCollectionNames('ml_');\n\nnotebookGlobal.__sq = {\n  path,\n  fs,\n  execSync,\n  HOME_DIR,\n  SCRIPTORIUM_ROOT,\n  WORKSPACE_ROOT,\n  TMP_DIR,\n  TEMPLATE_FILE,\n  NNB_DIR,\n  VECTOR_DB_DIST,\n  vm,\n  client,\n  mlCollections,\n};\n\nconsole.log(`🧭 Chroma heartbeat: ${heartbeat}`);\nconsole.log(`Template file: ${TEMPLATE_FILE}`);\nconsole.log(`TMP dir: ${TMP_DIR}`);\nconsole.table(mlCollections.map(function(collectionName) {\n  return { collection: collectionName };\n}));\n\nif (!fs.existsSync(TEMPLATE_FILE)) {\n  throw new Error(`No existe el archivo de plantilla: ${TEMPLATE_FILE}`);\n}\n\nif (mlCollections.length !== 5) {\n  console.warn(`⚠️ Esperaba 5 colecciones ml_*, encontré ${mlCollections.length}.`);\n}\n\nvoid 0;"
            ],
            "outputs": [
                {
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "mime": "application/vnd.code.notebook.stdout",
