        {
            "language": "markdown",
            "source": [
                "## Lote completo — las 5 secciones\n\nEsta celda recorre todas las secciones parseadas, ejecuta sus queries y sobrescribe los markdown de salida en `tmp/`."
            ],
            "outputs": []
        },
        {
            "language": "typescript",
            "source": [
                "const sqBatch = globalThis.__sq;\nconst batchOutputs = [];\n\nfor (const section of sqBatch.sections) {\n  const output = await sqBatch.writeSection(section);\n  batchOutputs.push({\n    section: section.sectionNumber,\n    collection: section.collectionName,\n    file: sqBatch.path.basename(section.outputPath),\n    queries: section.queryTexts.length,\n    nResults: section.nResults.min,\n  });\n}\n\nsqBatch.batchOutputs = batchOutputs;\nconsole.table(batchOutputs);\nconsole.log(`✓ Se escribieron ${batchOutputs.length} archivos de sección en ${sqBatch.TMP_DIR}`);\n\nvoid 0;"
            ],
            "outputs": [
                {
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "mime": "application/vnd.code.notebook.stdout",
                            "value": [
                                "┌─────────┬─────────┬─────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┬─────────┬──────────┐",
                                "│ (index) │ section │ collection          │ file                             │ queries │ nResults │",
                                "├─────────┼─────────┼─────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────┼─────────┼──────────┤",
                                "│ 0       │ 1       │ 'ml_hilo_narrativo' │ 'seccion-1-ml_hilo_narrativo.md' │ 5       │ 5        │",
